  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0-preview updates the MCP integration for Mythosia.AI 8.0.0 and its shared tool and Run contracts. Registered tools propagate cooperative cancellation; tool and transport failures become failed results. Direct CallToolAsync now throws McpException for an MCP isError result, so callers that previously consumed error strings must migrate. Concurrent DisposeAsync calls await shared cleanup, and transport disposal proceeds even when cancellation callbacks fail. Malformed matching responses keep requests pending for a later valid response or cancellation; new calls fail after disposal starts or the read loop stops. Inherited Run results use AIRunResult and callers read Text for the answer. Remote server actions are not undone or guaranteed to stop by client cancellation. Migration: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/docs/v8-migration.md Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/integrations/Mythosia.AI.Mcp/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v010-preview",
